    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Plugin with extra shipping methods for Woocommerce.</p>\n<p>Support <a href=\"https://coffee-code.tech/#contact\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Coffee Code</a>.</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Create Free Shipping methods by Shipping Class in WooCommerce.</li>\n<li>&#8220;Exclusive&#8221; option to make the method appear only if no other shipping method is available in the cart.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Requirements</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>PHP version 7.4 or higher.</li>\n<li>WooCommerce version 7.0.x or higher.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload this plugin to your WordPress, and activate it;</li>\n<li>Go to the side menu &#8220;WooCommerce &gt; Settings &gt; Shipping&#8221;;</li>\n<li>Add and configure the custom shipping method.</li>\n<li>Add Title and application rules.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1 &#8211; 07/08/2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added fallback method option.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0 &#8211; 01/08/2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release (Beta)</li>\n<li>Delivery method &#8211; Free shipping with delivery class</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
